WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Availability is not access. Reveal barriers across the full cannabis care journey.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Trace learning, eligibility and cost.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Map travel, supply and support.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Expose privacy and language barriers.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Test continuity after entry.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Design cannabis care around the journey.
